    "title": "Permits Issued for Five-Unit Mixed-Use Project at 2909 Ridge Avenue in Strawberry Mansion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By YIMBY Team ,\n21 hours ago Permits have been issued for the construction of a three-story mixed-use building at 2909 Ridge Avenue in Strawberry Mansion, North Philadelphia. The project will contain 7,229 square feet of construction area, with a basement, five dwelling units, and a shell commercial space. Bamicks Holdings LLC is listed as the owner. Philly Plans is responsible for the designs, while BFB Construction LLC is listed as the contractor. Read full article\n1",
